{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"4a4153b9eabb4207fe81f873b8db86cf6e515fca451f4c68317fcf80b5d94c4d","ja":"平気な演技","zh":"若无其事的演技","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c7cbdb4ecc0b2656283d986c2e5dc0edd8a8693d6b3f25a82000aca60f557414","ja":"チャンネルは、そのまま！\n……って、今回の配信にCMはないでしょ～♪","zh":"不要换台哦！\n……话说，这次的直播可没有广告啦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ca4fbd9cba36a11adcbceb14e95c73f5e1ec11884fdc4e5466d35419ef9a754d","ja":"それじゃあ改めて、\n亜美ちゃんが考えたオリジナルの能力はなに？","zh":"那么言归正传，\n亚美想出来的原创超能力是什么？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a14081bf5e835f1e38780a2888cc12aee1cfb147644ec831fd78be8fd18878fd","ja":"それはだね、イタズラを極めたい亜美的には……\n『イタズラに引っかからない能力』だよ～！","zh":"那个嘛，对于想把恶作剧钻研到极致的亚美来说……\n就是“不被恶作剧骗到的能力”哦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c2e621005c1a89086f49d2d8e751041ae7423dbc0a79c691254180a3abe917cc","ja":"『イタズラに引っかからない能力』？\n『イタズラが絶対成功する能力』じゃないんだ？","zh":"“不会中恶作剧的能力”？\n不是“恶作剧绝对能成功的能力”吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4d105411f0bc71b431d20957f434164a6427c1fcdfd9011634e22174b4d321ed","ja":"そんなのつまんないよ！　成功するかどうかドキドキ\n見守るのが、イタズラのソダイゴミっしょ～！","zh":"那样太无聊啦！提心吊胆地守望着\n到底会不会成功，才是恶作剧的精髓所在吧～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"701892ec1b00687f9b31fa30cc79491ad73c9fa77b450f08fd4b6b79a5ca6354","ja":"『ソダイゴミ』？　……あ、『ダイゴミ』だね！\nそれはプロのこだわり、なのかな？","zh":"“大型垃圾”？……啊，是“精髓”对吧！\n这就是职业意识的讲究，吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"575a2137d9582887b52e1636826019dc1e77444ffe7615c2806c57c2e6a48fca","ja":"……あ、今、神の声をビビッと受信したよ～！\nえ～っと……。","zh":"……啊，刚才本大仙感应到了神仙的声音哦～！\n让我想想……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"a9c12b4deec324ac31e7af6ab10a1af007526203efeb2c30534eb41d8c2166a2","ja":"「イタズラを回避するには危険を察知する直感も必要！\nなので、ロシアンスイーツを行います！」だって！","zh":"“‘为了避开恶作剧，察觉危险的直觉也是必不可少的！\n所以，我们要进行俄罗斯轮盘点心游戏！’”她是这么说的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"643156ce0e222521fad4628e949d0d994d438273383e94ad53a9db3eeb7b8428","ja":"ハズレを食べても平気なフリをするから、\n誰が辛いのを食べたか、予想してみてね～！","zh":"就算吃到中招的也会装作没事，\n猜猜看是谁吃到了辣的吧～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"0433de9689203c15d17a0014b396950389683ccb2d9354248d4cc199eb45a0e5","ja":"まずはロシアンチョコです！　みんな、選んだ？\nそれじゃあ、せーので食べるよ。せーの……。","zh":"首先是俄罗斯轮盘巧克力！大家选好了吗？\n那么，数到三就一起吃哦。预备……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"6a561f3a6e7f471ae2a93666f7351697d5dfd0d1d284d19d742871cea8671b98","ja":"……わっ、からっ…………じゃなかった。\nか、か……かなり、オイシイ～……。","zh":"……哇，好辣…………才不是呢。\n相、相……相当好吃～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"66180f4944330c85ca5d33dc8fe0de2586451fda5005515a16fc94da8778fd9f","ja":"あはは。未来、バレバレだよ。","zh":"啊哈哈。未来，早就露馅了哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"2dcd61a8051eed7218809eea2673c8c3d71ced826db0487819fa93a7a7104603","ja":"うう～……からすぎて\n演技するの、忘れちゃったよ～。","zh":"呜呜～……太辣了，\n我都忘了还要演戏啦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"768cb6a9e9435a9d9418fff2629edeca71645fd82de0e9c160aca841d9f022c9","ja":"2問めのマシュマロもおいし～……ってあれ？\n誰も変な顔、してなくない？","zh":"第2题的棉花糖也好好吃～……咦，等等？\n大家怎么都没露出奇怪的表情啊？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"6bb358718c4c88d5754a4a25a988301cdf67abd5edfb42bda57a56095fee1e3d","ja":"ホントだ。コメントのみんなも誰が当たったか\nわからないみたいだね？　ハズレなし、なのかな？","zh":"真的呢。看评论区的大家好像也\n不知道是谁中奖了呢？难道全员都有奖吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"709027af0909db9f4ec9f44d284999ed1c04e7af07b5d56eeb574c49b0bd0924","ja":"……なーんて。えへへ。正解は杏奈でした～！\nビビッと、頑張って耐えたよ～！","zh":"……开玩笑的。嘿嘿。正解是杏奈哦～！\n我有拼尽全力忍住哦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1640.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"e1bbf8ed27f969001aa55dc9a4aeef654130bacd6780c54bccf633f498da86aa","ja":"それじゃあ、次のスイーツ……\nの前に、お水飲ませて！　から～いっ！","zh":"那么，接下来是甜点……\n在这之前，先让我喝口水！好辣～啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
